{"ts":"2026-07-24T21:01:07.495Z","author":"codex-searxng-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Scope\\nComplete the stable SearXNG search and read-only operations surface through one cohesive CLI contract. Preserve the already shipped LAN routing, HTML fallback, TOON v4, setup wizard, global state, unlimited cache, SDK, formatter validation, and release guarantees.\\n\\n## Delivery\\nAdd stable instance operational commands, focused help, strict schemas/tests/docs, current PM packages, full live and installed acceptance, GitHub bot convergence, merge, and release proof."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"searx-7uik"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Complete SearXNG operational parity and agent-native release delivery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Implement the remaining upstream operational surfaces, complete command-level help and machine output contracts, refresh the governed PM toolchain, and ship verified local-service behavior through release automation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Plan"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent","cli","feature-parity","operations","pm-governance","quality","release","searxng","toon"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:01:07.495Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:01:07.495Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-07-25T21:01:07.495Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-searxng-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-searxng-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The CLI exposes documented operational instance statistics and error diagnostics from the configured SearXNG service with validated TOON-default and JSON machine contracts; every command and subcommand has focused help with global flags; arbitrary search parameters, autocomplete, configuration discovery, setup, global state, and unlimited persistent caching retain full compatibility; repo-local @unbrained/pm-cli and project pm-changelog match registry latest; all source remains erasable type-safe TypeScript with 100/100/100/100 coverage and 100% module docstrings; full quality, security, package, installed npm/Bun consumer, live LAN, PM graph, GitHub review, merged-head, and daily auto-release gates pass"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"Complete historical PM state, live instance capabilities, official current SearXNG docs, current CLI behavior, and latest tool versions are verified before implementation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"Full SearXNG CLI parity"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Agent-native operational and search workflows"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"One private, scriptable CLI surface for search and instance diagnostics"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Agents and CI can inspect and search the governed local service without browser-only gaps"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Release-ready CLI with explicit live operational contracts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The local instance exposes metrics/error surfaces not represented by intuitive CLI commands, and repo-local PM tooling trails the required latest version."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"searx-repo-health-2026"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"github-bots"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":95},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-operational-parity"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"next"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"searx-auto-release","k